BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td () Tj T* (Our pilot center, with a monthly rent of 2,100 dollars and a paid staff of one site lead and) Tj T* (six part-time tutors, reached center-level break-even in its sixth week. At 74 students, unit) Tj T* (economics showed a contribution margin of about 31 percent after tutor pay, books, and rent. We) Tj T* (expect margin to rise toward 40 percent as the matching engine lets each tutor handle more) Tj T* (students per hour and as book shelves are reused across cohorts.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Competition) Tj T* () Tj T* (Our competitors fall into three groups. National tutoring chains offer individualized help but) Tj T* (charge 40 to 70 dollars per hour and rarely locate in low-income districts. Digital reading) Tj T* (apps are cheap and scalable, but they depend on a child having a device, a quiet room, and) Tj T* (self-discipline, which our families often lack, and they provide no human relationship. Library) Tj T* (and nonprofit programs are free and trusted, but they offer limited personalization and little) Tj T* (outcome data.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Shelfmark's difference is the combination: a physical neighborhood presence, tutors matched by) Tj T* (data, and book matching based on a precise reading level. We know of no program that does all) Tj T* (three at a price families in our neighborhoods can pay. Our defensibility grows with data:) Tj T* (every session improves our matching model, and a larger dataset of child-tutor-book pairings is) Tj T* (hard for a newcomer to replicate.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Maribel Okonkwo-Reyes, chief executive, is a senior studying education policy and spent two) Tj T* (summers coordinating a library reading program. Tobias Lindqvist-Hart, chief technology) Tj T* (officer, is a computer science senior who built the matching engine and diagnostic. Priyanka) Tj T* (Venkataraghavan, head of curriculum, is a graduate student in literacy education and a former) Tj T* (elementary teacher who designed our tutor training. Dwayne Castellano, head of operations,) Tj T* (studies business and previously managed a community center, where he built relationships with) Tj T* (the school principals who referred our first families. All four of us are based at our) Tj T* (university and work on Shelfmark more than thirty hours a week.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (We have defined the core concept, built a working prototype of the diagnostic and matching) Tj T* (software, and incorporated Shelfmark as a Delaware C Corporation with equal founder equity. Our) Tj T* (website is live and handles enrollment. Over one eight-week summer we ran a pilot center) Tj T* (serving 74 children, 61 of whom were paying families or district-sponsored. The pilot generated) Tj T* (21,300 dollars in revenue, including a 12,000 dollar contract with one elementary school. The) Tj T* (average child gained 0.4 grade levels in reading over the summer, compared with the typical) Tj T* (loss of a few months, and 91 percent of enrolled children attended at least 12 of 16 sessions.) Tj T* (Parent satisfaction averaged 4.7 out of 5.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Our plan for the next twelve months is to open three new centers in time for the coming summer,) Tj T* (serve about 550 students, and reach roughly 118,000 dollars in revenue. We project center-level) Tj T* (profitability at all sites and company-wide break-even in the second year as software licensing) Tj T* (grows.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Ask For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are seeking 85,000 dollars in prize money or seed funding. About 45,000 dollars would fund) Tj T* (the three new centers, covering deposits, first-quarter rent, book collections, and tutor) Tj T* (training. About 25,000 dollars would extend the software to support more levels and a parent) Tj T* (dashboard. The remaining 15,000 dollars would cover legal, insurance, and an independent) Tj T* (evaluation of student outcomes, which we believe is the key to winning district contracts.) Tj T* (Beyond funding, we would value introductions to school district officials and mentors who have) Tj T* (scaled local service businesses.) Tj ET
endstream
